- Null validationContext leads to NullPointerException
- Null config in validationContext leads to NullPointerException
- Null KeywordWalkListenerRunner leads to NullPointerException
- Pre‑walk listener throws RuntimeException (ensuring post‑walk not called? Actually pre-walk inside try before finally; if exception thrown before finally block, finally still runs post-walk. So test that post-walk still invoked despite pre-walk exception.)
- Post‑walk listener throws RuntimeException (exception propagates)
- validator.getEvaluationPath returns null causing NPE before pre-walk listener call.
- validator.getEvaluationPath returns non-null but getName(-1) throws exception? getName may throw IndexOutOfBounds? If path empty, getName(-1) maybe error. So scenario where evaluationPathWithKeyword is empty causing getName(-1) to throw IndexOutOfBoundsException or IllegalArgumentException. We'll test that.

